From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:35:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ieframe: WebBrowser control members, persistence, verbs,
 history, target frames, document-site interfaces

The WebBrowser control gets its container-facing members (Parent, Container, Type, properties, status text, full name), IPersist* with a small own blob, IOleObject verbs/monikers/update, IOleControl FreezeEvents, IViewObject and IDataObject answers, ITargetFrame/ITargetFrame2/IHlinkFrame, IUrlHistoryStg2 over the wininet History container, and the interfaces ieframe offers to the hosted document (client/in-place/control site, frame, ambient dispatch, IShellBrowser). window.close fires WindowClosing.

